    {"id":"skill-review","hard":false,"changes":false,"skillCase":true,"moreCase":false,"skills":["code-review"],"asked":[],"passed":true,"problem":null,"calls":[{"tool":"git_status","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop"}},{"tool":"git_diff","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop"}},{"tool":"read_file","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop\\src\\cart.py"}},{"tool":"read_file","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop\\src\\cart.py"}},{"tool":"run_tests","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop"}},{"tool":"list_directory","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop"}},{"tool":"list_directory","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop\\src"}},{"tool":"read_file","args":{"path":"C:\\Users\\me\\Projects\\shop\\src\\cart.py"}}],"seconds":24.17,"tokens":648,"promptTokens":2841,"keptTokens":948,"readTokens":1893,"readSeconds":2.930,"readTokensPerSecond":646,"writtenTokens":648,"writeSeconds":20.700,"writtenTokensPerSecond":31.3,"toolCalls":8,"toolCallWriteMs":6334,"toolRunMs":0,"guessed":519,"guessesTaken":343,"toolTimes":[{"tool":"git_status","writeMs":785,"runMs":0},{"tool":"git_diff","writeMs":781,"runMs":0},{"tool":"read_file","writeMs":835,"runMs":0},{"tool":"read_file","writeMs":836,"runMs":0},{"tool":"run_tests","writeMs":797,"runMs":0},{"tool":"list_directory","writeMs":708,"runMs":0},{"tool":"list_directory","writeMs":750,"runMs":0},{"tool":"read_file","writeMs":842,"runMs":0}],"answer":"I reviewed the uncommitted change in `src/cart.py` (the only modified file).\n\n## Bugs\n\n**1. Discount is applied twice** — `src/cart.py`, `line_total`\n```python\ntotal = price * quantity * (1 - discount)\n# members get their discount\ntotal = total * (1 - discount)\n```\nThe discount is multiplied in twice, so a 10% discount becomes 19% off (0.9 × 0.9 = 0.81). Fix: apply it once:\n```python\ntotal = price * quantity * (1 - discount)\nreturn round(total, 2)\n```\n\n**2. Function body is missing** — `src/cart.py`\nThe file currently contains only the signature:\n```python\ndef line_total(price, quantity, discount):\n```\nThere's no body, so this file won't even import (`IndentationError`). The diff shows the body was replaced, but the working file has lost it entirely — it looks like the edit didn't save correctly.\n\n## Risks\n\n- **No validation of `discount`** — a discount ≥ 1.0 produces a zero or negative line total. Worth clamping or raising if that's possible in your data.\n\n## Clean-ups\n\n- The `# members get their discount` comment is misleading — it's the same discount parameter, not a separate member discount.\n\n## Looks good\n\n- The `quantity <= 0` early return is a fine guard.\n\nI couldn't run tests or a build — the project has no test/build setup (only `src/cart.py` exists).\n\n**Bottom line:** don't commit this as-is. The file is syntactically broken and the discount logic double-applies the discount. Want me to fix both?"},
